> don't usually have good luck polying monsters any way, they almost
> always become a master mindflayer or master Lich.  I don't have poly
> control, so I dare not use it on me since I almost always become some
> random F and can't do anything..
>
> What can I do to get out of this shop without getting killed?

Hmm, tricky. It's probably worth your while identifying as many potions
as you can. Use price-ID before reading your scrolls. There are some
potions that could help you - cursed gain level is one, speed might
just about allow you to bust the door down and escape the angry
shopkeep. There's a very small chance that if you find the right type
of potion you could wish your way out (or rather, wish yourself an item
that allows you to escape) and I'm sure there are other possibilities
I've missed.

If that doesn't help, you could polypile the potions and/ or other
items and hope for something more useful. For example, polypile scrolls
and wand of striking and hope for teleport. Poly your spare weapon(s)
and hope for a mattock. Polypile the marker and hope for a pickaxe
(although I know I would find it hard to sacrifice a marker in this
way).

Bear in mind the shopkeeper will want you to pay for any of his stuff
you change or use. Watch out for busted potions with that /oStriking as
well.

Good luck.



